            "imageurl": "images/skills/1221-122102.png",
            "DescriptionEN": "Restores HP equal to [3]% of Yunli's ATK plus [4]. Deals Physical DMG equal to [1]% of Yunli's ATK to a single target enemy and Physical DMG equal to [2]% of Yunli's ATK to adjacent targets.",
            "DescriptionCN": "回复等同于云璃[3]%攻击力+[4]的生命值，并对指定敌方单体造成等同于云璃[1]%攻击力的物理属性伤害，对其相邻目标造成等同于云璃[2]%攻击力的物理属性伤害。",
